OL,3,GNEWSATeenager remains confused why
OL,4,Ano-one was evacuated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who called emergency
OL,7,Fservices to report a strong smell of
OL,8,Fgas at a block of flats that later
OL,9,Fexploded, killing 10 people, said he
OL,10,Fremained confused "to this day" as to
OL,11,Fwhy no-one was evacuated.
OL,13,FPedro De Freitas, who was 14 at the
OL,14,Ftime, was walking past Haut du Mont
OL,15,Fwith his two friends on 9 December
OL,16,F2022, the night before the explosion,
OL,17,Fand reported the area "stank of gas".
OL,19,FJersey's Royal Court heard he called
OL,20,Femergency services at about 20:35 GMT
OL,21,Fand waited for the fire service to
OL,22,Farrive.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
